Digital Calculator

A practical project in development to solidify skills in HTML, CSS Grid, and JavaScript, implementing state management and event handling.

🚀 Features

    Responsive interface with CSS Grid

    Basic operations (addition, subtraction, multiplication, division)

    DOM event handling

    Modern and accessible design

🛠️ Technologies

    HTML5 - Semantic structure

    CSS3 - Grid Layout and Flexbox

    JavaScript - Programming logic and DOM manipulation


